---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Delete Your Account – Fullfill">
  <section class="delete-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Delete Your Account & Data</h1>

      <p><strong>Updated 3 Dec 2025</strong></p>

      <p>
        This page explains how to permanently delete your Fullfill account and all associated data.
        Once deleted, your data cannot be restored.
      </p>

      <h2>What Will Be Deleted</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>Your Fullfill account</li>
        <li>All journal entries</li>
        <li>Progress data and routines</li>
        <li>Preferences and activity history</li>
        <li>Any data stored in your profile</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Delete Your Account</h2>

      <p>
        Open the Fullfill app and go to:
      </p>

      <p><strong>Settings → Account → Delete Account</strong></p>

      <p>
        Deletion happens instantly and is permanent.
      </p>

      <h2>If You Can't Access the App</h2>

      <p>
        You can request deletion manually by contacting us below. Your request must come from the email address used to create your Fullfill account.
      </p>

      <p>
        <a href="mailto:hello@fullfill.me?subject=Account%20Deletion%20Request">
          Request Account Deletion
        </a>
      </p>

      <h2>How Long Deletion Takes</h2>

      <p>
        Deletion through the app is immediate. Email requests are processed within 7 days.
      </p>

      <h2>Data We May Retain</h2>

      <p>
        For security, fraud prevention and legal compliance, limited non-personal technical logs may be retained for up to 30 days. These logs cannot identify you.
      </p>

      <h2>Need Help?</h2>

      <p>
        Email us at
        <a href="mailto:hello@fullfill.me">hello@fullfill.me</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .delete-section {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 60px 20px;
  }

  .container {
    width: 100%;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-top: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  p,
  li {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  p {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  ul {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    padding-left: 24px;
  }

  p:first-of-type {
    color: var(--text-secondary, #666);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .delete-section {
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    p,
    li {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
